      "writtenOn": "2020-08-27T16:54:44Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Initializing this is unnecessary, because the path where it doesn\u0027t get a new value will never use this variable. If schedule_deferred_pd_interrupt were called with port \u003d\u003d -1, it would cause an out-of-bounds array access. If you want to protect against calling schedule_deferred_pd_interrupt with an invalid port, then check (assert) for port \u003d\u003d -1 before you call. That\u0027s optional, though, for the reason described above.",
      "revId": "b94085bb569cca7e2fb102e6b0adc3f6c199084b",
      "serverId": "3ce6091f-6c88-37e8-8c75-72f92ae8dfba",
